---
import TreatmentLayout from '../../components/TreatmentLayout.astro';
import PriceBlock from '../../components/PriceBlock.astro';
import { superloop } from '../../data/services';
---

<TreatmentLayout
  title="Superloop"
  metaTitle="Superloop volumising treatment"
  description="The Superloop at Maison Coiffure: a volumising treatment that makes hair appear fuller, from €89. The result lasts approximately six weeks."
  lede="More volume, or help making a crown fall beautifully again."
  ctaLabel="Ask about a Superloop"
  waMessage="Hello Maison Coiffure, I would like to know whether a Superloop suits my hair."
>
  <p>
    Do you want more volume in your hair, or help making a crown fall beautifully again? A Superloop
    is a volumising treatment intended to make hair appear fuller. It is especially suitable when
    the hair on top is no longer than 15 cm, and the result lasts approximately six weeks.
  </p>
  <p>
    After the treatment your hair is blow-dried and styled, and the Superloop can be combined with a
    haircut in the same visit.
  </p>
  <p>
    Whether a Superloop suits your hair, and how long your appointment needs, is agreed personally
    before booking. Send a message and we will look at it together.
  </p>

  <Fragment slot="after">
    <PriceBlock group={superloop} headingLevel="h2" />
  </Fragment>
</TreatmentLayout>
